r. Check the courier’s official site for live delivery updates.</p>@endif @if($order->received_at)<p>Inspection window ends <strong>{{ $order->received_at->copy()->addHours(72)->format('M d, Y · g:i A') }}</strong> (Asia/Manila).</p>@endif @if($order->dispute)<div class="notice error"><strong>Dispute submitted</strong><p class="preserve">{{ $order->dispute }}</p><p>This prototype records the report. Resolution and refunds require manual handling; no funds are held here.</p></div>@endif</div></div><aside><div class="notice">This is a reservation workflow. No payment, escrow deposit, payout or refund occurs on this site.</div><div class="panel"><h2>Next step</h2>@if(auth()->id()===$order->listing->seller_id && $order->status==='reserved')<p>After arranging the order with your buyer, record the shipment below.</p><form class="form" method="post" action="{{ route('orders.update',$order) }}">@csrf<input type="hidden" name="action" value="ship"><label for="courier">Courier</label><select id="courier" name="courier">@foreach(['LBC','J&T','Lalamove'] as $courier)<option>{{ $courier }}</option>@endforeach</select><label for="tracking_number">Tracking reference</label><input id="tracking_number" name="tracking_number" maxlength="100" required><button class="button dark full">Mark as shipped ↗</button></form>@elseif(auth()->id()===$order->buyer_id && $order->status==='shipped')<p>Only confirm receipt when you have the parcel. This starts your 72-hour inspection window.</p><form method="post" action="{{ route('orders.update',$order) }}">@csrf<input type="hidden" name="action" value="receive"><button class="button dark full">I received the component ✓</button></form>@elseif(auth()->id()===$order->buyer_id && $order->status==='inspection')<p>Inspect the component against the listing before confirming.</p><form method="post" action="{{ route('orders.update',$order) }}">@csrf<input type="hidden" name="action" value="complete"><button class="button dark full">Component matches ✓</button></form>@if(now()->lte($order->received_at->copy()->addHours(72)))<hr><form class="form" method="post" action="{{ route('orders.update',$order) }}">@csrf<input type="hidden" name="action" value="dispute"><label for="dispute">Something doesn’t match?</label><textarea id="dispute" name="dispute" rows="4" minlength="20" maxlength="3000" placeholder="Describe the issue and your diagnostic findings." required>{{ old('dispute') }}</textarea><button class="button outline full">Submit dispute report</button></form>@else<p class="notice">The 72-hour dispute window has ended.</p>@endif @else<p>{{ match($order->status) {'reserved'=>'Waiting for the seller to arrange shipment.','shipped'=>'Waiting for the buyer to confirm receipt.','inspection'=>'The buyer is inspecting the component.','completed'=>'The buyer confirmed the component matches the listing.','cancelled'=>'This reservation was cancelled and stock was restored.','disputed'=>'A dispute has been recorded for manual review.',default=>'No action needed.'} }}</p>@endif @if($order->status==='reserved')<hr><form method="post" action="{{ route('orders.update',$order) }}">@csrf<input type="hidden" name="action" value="cancel"><button class="text-button danger">Cancel reservation</button></form>@endif</div></aside></section>@endsection
